# BlackBread — Windsurf / Cascade rules (pointer; the full rules live in the repo)

Converse in Bahasa Indonesia; English for code, schemas, and IDE/agent prompts.

Authority order: AGENTS.md -> ADR-FINAL-002.md §0 -> PRD.md -> .devin/rules/blackbread.md ->
config/capability-registry.json -> GAP-REGISTER.md. Read live GitHub + ENGINEERING-STATE.md before
acting; never work from chat memory. How-to lives in .devin/skills/blackbread-engineering/ (SKILL.md
+ references/). Lower authority may strengthen but never weaken higher; on any conflict, STOP and
report — do not choose the easier rule.

Run every implementation as the 12-stage delivery spine (SKILL.md, "Delivery lifecycle — the spine"):
1 LIVE BASELINE  2 SLICE/DESIGN GATE  3 BOUNDED EXECUTION CONTRACT  4 TDD RED -> MINIMUM GREEN
5 SELF-REVIEW COMPLETE DIFF  6 LOCAL HARD PREFLIGHT ALL GREEN  7 OPEN READY PR
8 ONE EXACT-HEAD ADVERSARIAL REVIEW  9 ONE COHESIVE CORRECTION  10 FINAL CURRENT-HEAD SEAL
11 (owner) SQUASH MERGE  12 VERIFY PROTECTED MAIN.
Do not skip or reorder a stage. Opening a PR before local preflight is green is a task failure.

One vertical slice per PR. Strict TDD (RED first). Deterministic code owns safety, scope, budgets,
and gates; the LLM emits typed proposals only, never executes or gates. No placeholder code. Advisory
bot findings are validated, not gated — only a reproduced, valid finding blocks; the binding
PR-Agent/DeepSeek review is mandatory for safety-critical paths. If a fix touches more than two files,
redesign the interface, do not patch. Documented != implemented != verified != released.

When writing an implementation prompt, fill
.devin/skills/blackbread-engineering/references/execution-prompt-template.md (file-map table,
per-defect proof obligations, single STOP/SPLIT list). Verify Oracle ARM64 only (uv sync + make
check); never bare pytest. Never emit the old Agent-Alpha idiom (PHASE:, §12.x, agent_alpha/ paths).
